pload  Total   Spent   Left   Speed\n\r  0      0   0      0   0      0      0      0                              0\r100  20248 100  20248   0      0 859.7k      0                              0\r100  20248 100  20248   0      0 858.2k      0                              0\r100  20248 100  20248   0      0 857.7k      0                              0\ntotal 8.4M\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 243K Dec 31  1979 API.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha  16K Dec 31  1979 ASSETS.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha  57K Dec 31  1979 CHANGELOG.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha  41K Dec 31  1979 CREDITS.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha  59K Dec 31  1979 GUIDE.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 173K Dec 31  1979 LIBRARY.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 1.1K Dec 31  1979 LICENSE\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 3.1K Dec 31  1979 README.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha  30K Dec 31  1979 check.mjs\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 2.6M Nov  4 22:18 engine-kit.zip\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 micha micha 4.0K Nov  4 22:18 examples\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 4.5K Dec 31  1979 game.js\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha  506 Dec 31  1979 index.html\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 422K Dec 31  1979 library.json\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha  18K Dec 31  1979 manifest.json\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 micha micha 4.0K Nov  4 22:18 packs\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha  226 Dec 31  1979 pixel-engine.d.ts\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 4.7M Dec 31  1979 pixel-engine.js\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 micha micha 4.0K Nov  4 22:17 src\ndrwxr-xr-x 4 micha micha 4.0K Nov  4 22:18 types\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 micha micha 4.0K Nov  4 22:18 vendor\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
