{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_22","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n '## (compileClips|validateClip|analyzeClip|parseSong|PixelHUD|Timeline|WaterSurface|ModelCatalog|Input)|class PixelHUD|class Timeline|function validateClip|function analyzeClip|compileClips\\\\(|gamepadButtons|setVolume\\\\(|Song|interface MoveInput' API.md | head -70 && rg -n '\"'^(##|###).*?(Hero|Rig|Animation|Clip|Song|HUD|Random|Input|Mirror|Timeline|Water|Settings)'\"' API.md && rg -n 'fountain|bench|flowers|lamp-post' LIBRARY.md | head -12\"","aggregated_output":"14:8. Audio: `attenuation`, `AudioManager`, `AudioSettings`, `Instrument`, `Listener`, `muffleCutoff`, `noteFrequency`, `parseSong`, `PLAYGROUND_SONG`, `PlayOptions`, `renderSound`, `SFX`, `SfxName`, `Song`, `SoundDef`, `Spatial`, `spatialize`, `SpatialOptions`, `Voice`, `VoiceSettings`, `VolumeChannel`, `Wave`\n2156:### interface MoveInput\n2275:KEYMAP). Change `input.gamepadButtons` to remap. Indices follow the W3C \"standard\" layout:\n2294:  (`gamepadButtons`). Polled once per frame by the engine (`beginFrame`).\n2311:- `gamepadButtons: Record<number, string>`: Gamepad button index → key code (defaults: GAMEPAD_BUTTONS).\n2465:sequencer (`Song`, data), optional audio files, and master / sfx / music volume + mute\n2490:- `playMusic(song: Song | null, name = 'song'): void`: Start a song (looping by default), replacing the current one. `null` stops music.\n2493:- `setVolume(channel: VolumeChannel, value: number): void`\n2536:### parseSong()\n2539:function parseSong(song: Song): ParsedSong\n2547:const PLAYGROUND_SONG: Song\n2582:### interface Song\n3541:### analyzeClip()\n3544:function analyzeClip(model: Object3D, rig: RigSpec, def: ClipDef, clip: AnimationClip): ClipReport\n3597:### compileClips()\n3600:function compileClips(defs: readonly ClipDef[], rig: RigSpec, model: Object3D): AnimationClip[]\n3844:### validateClip()\n3847:function validateClip(clip: ClipDef, rig: RigSpec): string[]\n4881:### class Timeline\n323:### loadSettings()\n331:### normalizeSettings()\n358:### interface PlayerSettings\n413:### interface QualitySettings\n460:### class Settings\n479:### interface SettingsHost\n492:### class SettingsPanel\n507:### storeSettings()\n513:### urlSettings()\n577:### class CameraRig\n604:### interface CameraRigState\n617:### createCameraRig()\n623:### class FirstPersonRig\n637:### class FreeRig\n655:### class OrthoRig\n666:### class ThirdPersonRig\n760:### interface EdgeSettings\n1569:### interface DriveInput\n2107:### interface WaterWave\n2156:### interface MoveInput\n2231:### readMoveInput()\n2240:## 7. Input and touch\n2287:### class Input\n2347:### interface InputFrame\n2367:### interface InputState\n2500:### interface AudioSettings\n2536:### parseSong()\n2582:### interface Song\n2645:### interface VoiceSettings\n2760:## 10. HUD\n3539:## 12. Animation toolkit\n3541:### analyzeClip()\n3547:### interface ClipDef\n3562:### interface ClipReport\n3587:### compileClip()\n3597:### compileClips()\n3634:### gaitClip()\n3764:### interface RigSpec\n3778:### sampleClip()\n3844:### validateClip()\n3852:## 13. Hero kit\n4469:### class Mirror\n4480:### interface MirrorOptions\n4881:### class Timeline\n4899:### interface TimelineLine\n4906:### interface TimelineOptions\n5073:### interface WaterOptions\n5086:### class WaterSurface\n92:| `bench` | 1.4 × 0.45 × 0.36 | length 1.4 (0.8–2.4) | wood orange, frame red, joint plum | furniture, wood | Backless plank bench, seat at 0.45 m on two notched board trestles and a dark stretcher |\n114:| `lamp-post` | 0.68 × 2.1 × 0.3 |  | iron night, flame sand | lighting, town | Iron street lamp with a hanging lantern |\n138:| `flowers` | 0.82 × 0.34 × 0.6 | r 0.4 (0.2–0.8) | stem green, leaf teal, a red, b sand, c sky | nature, plant, flower | Patch of wild flowers: chunky blossoms in red, sand and sky on short stems over leafy tufts in green and teal; `r` is its radius |\n179:| `fountain` | 2.26 × 1.81 × 2.26 | r 1.1 (0.8–1.6) | stone mist, trim slate, water blue, spray sky | town, stone, water | Round stone fountain: a basin wall under a dark coping round the pool, a centre column with an upper bowl and a jet; map `water` and `spray`; `r` is the basin's radius |\n183:| `park-bench` | 1.6 × 0.88 × 0.59 | length 1.6 (1–2.4) | iron night, wood orange, wood2 red | town, bench, iron, wood | Park bench: wooden slats on two cast-iron ends with armrests, seat at 0.45 m, the back leaning; `length` along x |\n270:| `meadow` | 32 × 32, tiles | shade teal, grass green, blade lime, petal white, bloom sand | surface, grass, ground, nature | A flower meadow: tall grass with light blades and white and yellow flowers dotted through it |\n451:| `kenney-furniture/bench` | 0.8 × 0.94 × 0.4 |  | wood sand | furniture, interior, seat | Bench |\n452:| `kenney-furniture/bench-cushion` | 0.8 × 0.92 × 0.4 |  | wood sand, carpet orange | furniture, interior, seat, cloth | Bench cushion |\n453:| `kenney-furniture/bench-cushion-low` | 0.84 × 0.4 × 0.44 |  | wood sand, metalLight white, carpet orange | furniture, interior, seat, cloth | Bench cushion low |\n890:| `kenney-tiny-dungeon/wall-fountain` | 16 × 16 | c2 mist, c4 mist, c5 night, c8 slate | dungeon, sprite, architecture, wall | Wall fountain |\n891:| `kenney-tiny-dungeon/wall-fountain-slime` | 16 × 16 | c2 mist, c4 mist, c5 night, c8 slate, c11 cyan, c13 green | dungeon, sprite, architecture, wall, character, monster | Wall fountain slime |\n1024:| `kenney-tiny-town/grass-flowers` | 16 × 16, tiles | c2 sand, c6 lime, c10 green, c11 sand, c13 white | town, sprite, surface, nature, plant, grass, flower | Grass flowers |\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
